*> ********************************************************
*> PROGRAM : FEE0044
*> PURPOSE : FEE EXEMPTIONS RULES
*> AUTHOR  : R.T.
*> CHANGE LOG:
*>   1987-09-12 ORIGINAL VERSION
*>   1998-10-07 THRESHOLDS UPDATED PER AUDIT REQ 687
*> RUN FROM JCL JOB FEENIGHT STEP080
*> ********************************************************
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. FEE0044.
ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
CONFIGURATION SECTION.
SOURCE-COMPUTER. IBM-370.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 WS-IN-REC.
    COPY FEE0044C REPLACING ==:PFX:== BY ==IN==.
01 OUT-RECORD.
    05 EXCESS-FEE         PIC 9(5)V99 VALUE ZERO.
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
0000-MAIN.
    ACCEPT WS-IN-REC
    PERFORM CHARGE-EXCESS
    PERFORM 3100-BUS-SURCHG
    DISPLAY "EXCESS-FEE=" EXCESS-FEE
    STOP RUN.
CHARGE-EXCESS.
    *> EXCESS TRANSACTION FEE
    IF IN-TXN-COUNT-MTH GREATER THAN 10
        COMPUTE EXCESS-FEE = (IN-TXN-COUNT-MTH - 10) * 0.75
    END-IF.
3100-BUS-SURCHG.
    *> BUSINESS HIGH-VOLUME SURCHARGE
    IF IN-ACCT-TYPE = 'B'
       AND IN-TXN-COUNT-MTH > 40
        ADD 15 TO EXCESS-FEE
    END-IF.
